<title>NICARAGUA: Nicaragua's inflation 0.4 percent in April.</title>
<headline>Nicaragua's inflation 0.4 percent in April.</headline>
<dateline>NICARAGUA 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nicaragua's consumer price index rose 0.4 percent in April, compared with a decline of 0.12 percent in March, the central bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Accumulated inflation for the year so far is 0.32 percent, it said.</p>
<p>Inflation in April 1996 was 0.9 percent.</p>
<p>((Managua bureau, +505 266-3300))</p>
